  "headline": "Bareskrim Expands Treason Probe Involving Former Chief Listyo Sigit",
  "seoTitle": "Bareskrim Investigates Listyo Sigit Over Treason Allegations",
  "metaDescription": "Bareskrim Polri has questioned 59 witnesses regarding treason allegations and illegal wiretapping involving former police chief Listyo Sigit and his team.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Bareskrim Polri is investigating 59 individuals, including former police chief Listyo Sigit and his associates, for alleged treason.",
    "The probe follows accusations of illegal wiretapping targeting President Prabowo Subianto and other public figures.",
    "Authorities are currently analyzing social media evidence, though no formal suspects have been named despite active case development."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police, specifically the Bareskrim division, is conducting an investigation into alleged treason involving former police chief Listyo Sigit and his associates. The case follows widespread allegations of illegal wiretapping that reportedly targeted President Prabowo Subianto, as well as media personalities and other government officials. Investigators have interviewed 59 witnesses and are expanding their evidence gathering to include social media activities. While the investigation remains active and has reached the stage of submission to the prosecutor's office, officials have clarified that no individuals have been officially named as suspects at this time. In response to the breach, the presidential palace has announced the establishment of a new cybersecurity team to enhance national security, while various observers and former officials continue to comment on the broader implications of the internal investigation within the national police force.",
